  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "heading": "What Cylinder Head Repair & Rebuild Involves",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "Our cylinder head service is a complete overhaul of the top end of your BMW engine. We follow a precise process to restore sealing, compression, and valve timing to factory standards."
        },
        {
          "t": "ul",
          "items": [
            "**Head removal** – the cylinder head is carefully lifted from the engine block.",
            "**Full strip-down** – all components (valves, springs, retainers, camshafts) are disassembled.",
            "**Inspection and measurement** – the head is checked for warpage, cracks, and wear; valve guides and seats are measured with precision tools.",
            "**Machining (skimming)** – the head is resurfaced to ensure a perfectly flat sealing surface.",
            "**Valve work** – valves are ground or replaced, new stem seals fitted, and seats recut or replaced.",
            "**Reassembly with new gaskets and seals** – including head gasket, camshaft seals, and all necessary O-rings.",
            "**VANOS service** – on engines equipped with BMW's variable valve timing, the VANOS unit is serviced during head work to maintain optimal performance."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "All work is carried out in our Essex workshop using specialist equipment and genuine or OEM-quality parts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
